    "summary_short": "In a lush fantasy world, a small woodland creature and a majestic bird find themselves bound together after a mysterious magical event swaps their bodies. Forced into an uneasy alliance to reverse the spell, the unlikely duo embarks on a perilous quest across the realm. Along the way, they discover a dark threat that puts both of their species and the entire ecosystem in danger. To save their home, these natural foes must learn to trust each other and overcome their deep-seated differences.",
    "summary_long": "Deep within a magical Valley, land-dwelling woodland creatures and soaring birds have lived as sworn enemies for generations. This long-standing conflict takes a dramatic turn when a humble woodland creature and a proud bird are caught in a mysterious magical spell that swaps their bodies. Thrust into unfamiliar physical forms and vulnerable environments, the natural foes realize they must cooperate if they ever hope to return to normal. As they trek across treacherous terrains to find a way to undo the magic, they are forced to see the world through each other's eyes, gradually softening their ancient prejudices. However, their personal quest quickly evolves into something much larger when they stumble upon a hidden, sinister plot threatening the Valley. This impending danger imperils not only their respective species, but the delicate balance of life in their entire home. Combining the bird's high-flying perspective with the woodland creature's ground-level ingenuity, the pair works together to dismantle the threat. Ultimately, their journey proves that empathy and unity can conquer even the deepest rivalries.",
